{
    "title": "xRooFit",
    "description": "<p>xRooFit is a high-level API for RooFit, designed for use in both Python and C++, with advanced capabilities for workspace creation, editing, and statistical analysis. xRooFit is bundled with ROOT as an experimental feature, as well as being available as a standalone software suite. xRooFit is extensively used in the ATLAS Collaboration at CERN.</p>",
